{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21983","headline":"浔阳三题 东林寺白莲 · 白居易","name":"浔阳三题 东林寺白莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东林北塘水，湛湛见底清。\n中生白芙蓉，菡萏三百茎。\n白日发光彩，清飙散芳馨。\n泄香银囊破，泻露玉盘倾。\n我慙尘垢眼，见此琼瑶英。\n乃知红莲花，虚得清净名。\n夏萼敷未歇，秋房结才成。\n夜深衆僧寝，独起绕池行。\n欲收一颗子，寄向长安城。\n但恐出山去，人间种不生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}